{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SK2 TARTAN FINDER (SCOTKILT — the /tartan-finder page in the pages.html design)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The same tartan browser as the `tartan-finder` section — same data, same
search, filters, A-Z, colourways, preview and product carousel — rendered from
the shared `tartan-finder-app` snippet under the SCOTKILT editorial skin.

The browser sits outside the .sk2 wrapper on purpose: `.sk2 :where(button)`
strips border, background and padding from every button inside it, which would
gut the component. It is skinned instead by redefining the colour-scheme
variables it reads — see assets/sk2-tartan-finder.css.

URL parameters: ?q=macdonald prefills the search, ?tartan=handle opens a tartan.
Documentation: docs/TARTAN-PICKER.md
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'sk2-home.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'tartan-picker.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'sk2-tartan-finder.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'tartan-picker.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'sk2-tartan-finder.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

<div class="sk2-tf">
  <div class="sk2">
    {%- if section.settings.show_breadcrumb -%}
      <div class="sk2__container sk2-tf__crumb">
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</span>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="sk2__container sk2-tf__intro">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="sk2-tf__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h1 class="{{ section.settings.heading_size }}">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <div class="lede">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- render 'tartan-finder-app', section: section, class: 'sk2-tf__app' -%}
</div>

